."}, {"turn": 43, "text": "With a lead of +18.3, the 10k played F5 and gave away 7.2 points, leaving +11.1. The engine's first choice was C9, so the cushion shrank without Opus 5.5 having to earn it."}, {"turn": 49, "text": "B1 cost the 10k another 5.4 points, from +10.7 to +5.3, the smallest lead of the late game. The engine preferred A8, and this was the closest Opus 5.5 came to a comeback."}]}, "audit": {"by": "Sonnet 5.5", "verdict": "clean", "reason": "Every command ran libs.py (groups and liberties of a pasted board), count.py (area count of the current position), or edited the notes files CLAUDE.md and games.md. None of these scripts generates, scores or ranks candidate moves or looks ahead, so they only analyze the current position and keep records.", "stop": false}}